WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.010
Who do you ask when the work really matters?

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:08.290
Someone who knows the field, and knows your company.

00:00:09.020 --> 00:00:11.190
It's like a good family doctor:

00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:14.290
they know medicine, and they know you.

00:00:15.020 --> 00:00:17.490
And you don't have to be a doctor yourself.

00:00:18.340 --> 00:00:21.590
So you can build that expert as an AI partner:

00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:28.150
for your own function, or for a field where you need help, for example finance for a marketing lead.

00:00:28.220 --> 00:00:32.990
And it works three ways: it does the work to your standard, reviews yours,

00:00:33.240 --> 00:00:35.290
and pushes back like a skeptical expert.

00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:40.870
Then your main tasks become skills, checked against your numbers and examples.

00:00:41.440 --> 00:00:44.210
And a lessons file makes every correction stick.

00:00:45.040 --> 00:00:45.970
You say it once.

00:00:46.680 --> 00:00:48.830
So in this adventure, you build your partner,

00:00:48.760 --> 00:00:51.070
and it gets sharper with every review.

00:00:51.720 --> 00:00:53.650
And when teammates do the same work,

00:00:53.740 --> 00:00:55.870
it can become a digital team member.
